sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 Mobile User
    participant Flutter as 📱 SKAVIA App
    participant Firebase as 🔥 Firebase Auth
    participant Supabase as ☁️ Supabase PostgreSQL

    User->>Flutter: Inputs Mobile Number (+880...)
    Flutter->>Firebase: verifyPhoneNumber(number)
    Firebase-->>User: 6-Digit SMS OTP Code
    User->>Flutter: Submits SMS Code
    Flutter->>Firebase: signInWithCredential(credential)
    Firebase-->>Flutter: UserCredential (UID & ID Token)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Flutter,Supabase: Handshake & Authorization
        Flutter->>Supabase: SELECT FROM users WHERE id = auth.uid()
        alt Account Exists
            Supabase-->>Flutter: User Record (id, primary_role)
            Flutter->>Flutter: Cache Session in FlutterSecureStorage
            Flutter->>User: Route to Dashboard
        else New Account
            Flutter->>User: Route to Role Selection
            User->>Flutter: Chooses Role (Customer / Worker / Business)
            Flutter->>Supabase: INSERT INTO users & user_roles
            Supabase-->>Flutter: Account Registered
            Flutter->>User: Route to Profile Wizard
        end
    end
